ISTIO CALIO
=====================

Authen & Author: Every micro service needs to communicate with each other that requires A&A

While communicating the services, that will share the data(adding personal details like sharing credit card info etc...) which is not encrpted

It's an infra layer that manages a service to servive communication within a micro services architecture. It improves the security, Traffic management, Observability

Before service mesh companies used nginx reverse proxy or load balancers as a service to service communicating. But it has security issues. That's why 
we are using service mesh now.

So to important istio we need to use side car containers in our pods.

The best side car for istio is Enovy

Because Enovy will helps us in load balancing, data security, Log Management.



reverse proxy vs forward proxy ------------> go to this website and understand the difference between reverse proxy vs forward proxy and what is reverse proxy means


